      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI-Powered Transaction Classification\n\n**WORKFLOW PURPOSE:**\nAutomatically classify incoming transactions as **IT** or **Product** using an AI function trigger.\n\n**PROCESS FLOW:**\n1. Receive transaction data from the Function trigger  \n2. Send key fields (price, tax, vendor) to an AI model  \n3. Parse the structured AI response  \n4. Store the transaction in an Excel sheet.\n\n**AI CAPABILITIES:**\n* Natural language interpretation of transaction descriptions  \n* Pattern recognition across vendors and spend types  \n* Structured output for easy routing  \n* Binary category classification (IT vs Product)  \n\n**BUSINESS VALUE:**\n* Faster transaction categorization  \n* Consistent, repeatable classification logic  \n* Reduced manual review  \n* Clear routing for downstream workflows ",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
